  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">EN PLEIN AIR</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5762 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-plein-air category-events\" id=\"post-5762\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/2021-plein-air-sessions/\" rel=\"bookmark\">2021 Plein Air Sessions</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-04-20T08:32:28-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, April 20, 2021, 8:32 am\">April 20, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Last season, the Guild’s weekly outside painting sessions allowed members to meet and paint while respecting social distancing.  We are surrounded by picturesque settings including waterfronts and harbors, wetlands, village <a href=\"/news/2021-plein-air-sessions/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5381 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-plein-air category-events category-news\" id=\"post-5381\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/en-plein-air-july-16-cape-cod-hydrangea-fest/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-equal thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"1025\" height=\"371\" alt=\"Hydrangeas in a garden with purple and blue flowers.\" src=\"/media/archive/01676294772cd63e5fd82d02e7823b6f4235cb9421ec5accf5eab0c162f08d6b.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/en-plein-air-july-16-cape-cod-hydrangea-fest/\" rel=\"bookmark\">En Plein Air July 16 – Cape Cod Hydrangea Fest</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2020-07-13T09:22:01-04:00\" title=\"Monday, July 13, 2020, 9:22 am\">July 13, 2020</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Thursday, July 16 the chosen en plein air location is a private garden part of the Cape Cod Hydrangea Festival. This is our chance to paint a fabulous garden in <a href=\"/news/en-plein-air-july-16-cape-cod-hydrangea-fest/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5319 post type-post status-publish format-gallery has-post-thumbnail category-plein-air category-events category-news\" id=\"post-5319\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/bells-neck-en-plein-air/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A woman holding an easel in front of a grassy area.\" src=\"/media/archive/3bf7d2e99e2c953c07cfafb701e13ea354dbbf0fbc0896c566b85bb4cc92137a.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/bells-neck-en-plein-air/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Bell’s Neck En Plein Air</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/archive/source-24ee350b4de3fb6c4205/\" class=\"post-format-link\">Gallery</a>\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2020-06-27T11:39:51-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, June 27, 2020, 11:39 am\">June 27, 2020</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>It started out sunny then became overcast but what fun watching the families come to catch crabs, a birder came to see the Sandhill Crane while walkers greeted us. Join <a href=\"/news/bells-neck-en-plein-air/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"gallery-count\">This gallery contains 5 items.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5348 post type-post status-publish format-gallery has-post-thumbnail category-plein-air category-events category-news\" id=\"post-5348\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/stony-brook-grist-mill/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"667\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Stony Brook Grist Mill\" src=\"/media/archive/642ae8e78f4556545adc49f278d4a7e6659d1518a4142bd3dcf5d123560ba855.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/stony-brook-grist-mill/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Stony Brook Grist Mill En Plein Air</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/archive/source-24ee350b4de3fb6c4205/\" class=\"post-format-link\">Gallery</a>\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2020-06-20T12:25:23-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, June 20, 2020, 12:25 pm\">June 20, 2020</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Although the Grist Mill was not open to the public, we artists were more than rewarded with a spectacular day on this beautifully clean crisp day 6/19/20. Lots of shadows <a href=\"/news/stony-brook-grist-mill/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"gallery-count\">This gallery contains 16 items.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5193 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-plein-air category-events category-news\" id=\"post-5193\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/thinking-outside-the-box-this-summer/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A Guild of Harwich Artists member diligently painting on an easel near a serene body of water.\" src=\"/media/archive/fcc9fb1fdf0bb07f9b2f518a72dd9a9a7d95f463587b8d39815b06b21935eb8d.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/thinking-outside-the-box-this-summer/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Thinking OUTSIDE-The-Box this Summer</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2020-06-15T11:31:59-04:00\" title=\"Monday, June 15, 2020, 11:31 am\">June 15, 2020</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Considering we are not able to be in close groups; I am encouraging you to paint outside with our weekly Thursday en plein air group! The outdoors is the best <a href=\"/news/thinking-outside-the-box-this-summer/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4660 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-plein-air category-events category-news tag-en-plein-air tag-west-harwich\" id=\"post-4660\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/en-plein-air-in-west-harwich/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"480\" height=\"492\" alt=\"A man standing outside near a painting easel.\" src=\"/media/archive/7b27f3477c79c6c6e74d69a47d65649a417edca9a26907a9b9eaba194af1eb2e.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/en-plein-air-in-west-harwich/\" rel=\"bookmark\">En Plein Air in West Harwich</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-07-06T21:41:24-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, July 6, 2019, 9:41 pm\">July 6, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Cindy Sauers allowed Guild members to paint the surroundings of her beautiful small farm.  Plenty of flowers, out buildings, and two very friendly sheep.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<nav class=\"navigation pagination\" aria-label=\"Posts pagination\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"screen-reader-text\">Posts pagination</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"nav-links\"><span class=\"page-numbers current\">1</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>2</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>3</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span>\n<a class=\"next page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>Next →</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span></div>\n\t</nav>\n\n\t\n",
